      "statement": "Per binding ADR 0002, the PortfolioSummary widget's numbers come from the DLMM Data API GET /portfolio/open server totals via the in-repo client fetchOpenPortfolioSummary — the widget data path has no RPC, SDK, or Helius dependency — while the in-app portfolio summary deliberately keeps client-side aggregation (computePoolPnLSummary); the two numeration paths are intentional, not drift. The position widget still uses the on-chain pipeline.",
