    {
      "id": "claim_68ba1c717f1e49bfbf80f75d4ff5aed4",
      "statement": "fetchOpenPortfolioSummary walks every page of /portfolio/open (page_size 50 by default, hard limit of 10 pages — exceeding it throws DlmmApiError because an incomplete result is worse than none) and rolls up the two fields the server does not aggregate: outOfRangeCount and the pool-value-weighted 24h feesTvl24h. Per-pool totalDepositSol is deliberately never rolled up because it is gross and double-counts redeposits after a withdrawal.",
